OL,3,AOfcom investigating Sky News over
OL,4,AFarage harassment claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FRegulator Ofcom has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation into Sky News over claims
OL,8,Fof harassment made by Reform UK leader
OL,9,FNigel Farage.
OL,11,FLast month, Farage accused the
OL,12,Fbroadcaster of infringing his family's
OL,13,Fprivacy by sending reporters to a house
OL,14,Fwhere his adult daughter was living.
OL,16,FReform UK made an official complaint to
OL,17,FOfcom, and called on Sky News to
OL,18,Fapologise on air and undertake not to
OL,19,Fseek to contact Farage's family at
OL,20,Ftheir homes.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
